⚡️🇺🇸 Donald Trump's adviser Natalie Harp worked at the White House for over a year without access to classified information, despite having unusually close access to the president and potentially confidential information.

After repeated internal warnings and pressure, including intervention from Trump, she eventually completed the vetting process and received the necessary clearance.

